<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-CENTRAL BANK LEAVES REPO RATES UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-CENTRAL BANK LEAVES REPO RATES UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday set unchanged repurchase  rates for the period to August 1.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was three percent, three months was 3.50 percent,  six-months was four percent and the 12-month rate was six percent.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
